WEBVTT

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:14.950
The last of the three Artifacts,
the Violin of the Earth God, is located...

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:16.040
...here.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.790
On the surface they are a trading firm.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.450
But behind the scenes, a gangster
who heads up a crime syndicate

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:26.450
spent a lot of money to obtain it
for his daughter's violin competition.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:31.870
He's trying to use the Artifact's
power to let his beloved daughter win.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:36.450
I understand the sentiment,
but it's also fundamentally wrong.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.910
His daughter probably doesn't
even know it's an Artifact.

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:41.620
She's done her best to succeed on her own,

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:45.450
and ends up cheating
without even knowing it. Poor girl.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:53.080
Just you wait. The master thief Hatena
will steal that sadness away, too!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:57.000
I'm fabricating a copy of the
Artifact for you to leave in its place.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.950
It will be finished soon.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:02.120
The notice has already been sent as well.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.910
The notice?

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.500
The notice regarding the Artifact.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.160
In exchange for the price of having
to inform our opponent beforehand,

00:01:11.160 --> 00:01:15.830
as soon as the target is stolen,
we can learn its true name.

00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:17.500
Wow, that's amazing.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.660
Of course it is. Mother
created the Artifact, after all.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.950
Big sister wrote what we put in the notice.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.200
You did?

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.330
"I, the master thief Hatena,
will be coming to steal your Artifact,

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:33.700
the Violin of the Earth God, on the
last day of the third week of August,

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.160
to put a stop to your
bringing sorrow to others!"

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.410
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:54.410 --> 00:01:58.330
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:04.160
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:07.950
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:11.120
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:02:11.120 --> 00:02:16.500
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:22.750
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.370
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:32.620
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:35.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.830
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.040
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:41.950
<i>so find me</i>

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.160
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:48.290
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.580
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:54.750
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.620
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:02.330
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:19.160
The Artifact is located in the instrument
storeroom on the third floor.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:22.870
Yumemi will piece together
the electronic key to unlock it.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.830
That's our Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.540
Master, I hope your Australian
performance is a successful one.

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:34.620
I'm honestly a little concerned
about not being able to help you.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.500
Knock them dead, kid.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:37.700
Right!

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.750
Master, we need to get going.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:43.950
Yeah, we're coming now.

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:52.410
Makoto, are you ready?

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:54.250
Mm-hmm.

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.250
Vanishing Magic!

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:04.200
We sure managed to get inside quick, huh?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.250
We've been practicing after all.

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:08.250
There they are!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.040
Whoa, they're already here.
Security really is tight.

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:14.410
Muff-<i>kun</i>, "Jeeves-<i>san</i>'s Slumber," if you please.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:20.700
Hatena, what is "Jeeves-<i>san</i>'s Slumber"?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:25.000
We got knocked out over and
over again by Jeeves-<i>san</i>, remember?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:29.120
I thought I could turn that into a move,
and took it up with Muff-<i>kun</i>.

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:29.950
Found it!

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.540
Yumemi, I found an electronic key.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:35.700
Remotely analyzing electronic key.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.700
Commencing alteration of user data.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:41.120
Rewrite complete.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.040
Lock release.

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.950
Thank you, Yumemi!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:46.700
You're welcome.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:58.950
Now you listen to me! This Artifact here...

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.830
...is testament that I have
become one of the upper crust,

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.450
and is a tool to make my daughter
the best musician in the world.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:09.250
I am not about to let you have it!

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.620
I've never seen real-life guns before.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.700
Mm-hmm, but it's not all
that scary. I wonder why.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:21.830
Probably because we've seen
even more amazing Artifacts before.

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.120
Whatever, just hurry up and shoot them!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:29.950
Ladies and gentlemen! Welcome
to Shiranui Makoto's magic show!

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.830
Smile Stick,

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.410
Illusion!

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:38.160
Shoot them! Shoot them!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:40.410
--What?!
--Water guns?

00:05:42.910 --> 00:05:45.330
Muff-<i>kun</i>, Wing Mode!

00:05:45.330 --> 00:05:48.540
Don't just stand there!
Hurry up and finish them!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:53.790
Muff-<i>kun</i>, Golden Embrace!

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:07.580
Don't think you're just
going to get away with this!

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.040
Wow, such a predictable line.

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:13.080
Never mind, please hurry up
and get out of there.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.910
You are up against a bunch
of grown-ups with guns.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.120
They may not be any match for Artifacts,

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.200
but they are not people you
should get sloppy around.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:21.080
Copy that.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:25.870
Smile Stick! Artifact Fake Change!

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:27.330
Huh?

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.700
There, the dummy has been safely
exchanged. Mission accomplished.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:37.450
What? You <i>didn't </i>come here to take the violin?

00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:42.120
Thank you for letting us steal
the Violin of the Earth God.

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:46.080
Please learn your lesson from
this and stop misusing Artifacts.

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.580
--Bye now!
--Bye now!

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.750
What was the deal with those two?

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:58.870
Our first real mission in a real sense,
not for training or a test,

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.200
was a big success, huh?

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:01.450
Mm-hmm.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.330
Welcome home, big sister and Makoto-<i>niisama</i>.

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:11.410
Congratulations on obtaining the Artifact.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.290
You two conducted yourselves
like true master thieves.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:18.500
Here you go. This is
the Violin of the Earth God.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.580
Wow, now we can get Mother back.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.080
Isn't that nice, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>?

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.040
Big sister, thank you.

00:07:29.410 --> 00:07:30.500
Makoto!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.160
Dina?

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:35.540
What exactly were you thinking?!

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:38.330
I was sure you were going
to meet up with us afterward!

00:07:38.330 --> 00:07:41.870
Why didn't you come to
Mr. Mamoru's performance?!

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:43.950
As his apprentice, aren't you ashamed?!

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.120
Well, I--

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.290
Today was an important performance!

00:07:47.290 --> 00:07:51.250
Mr. Mamoru and Master Gregory
are both your teachers,

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:54.620
and you should have been at
their side, no matter what it took!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:59.330
Dina, the truth is...

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:04.330
This makes things clear.
Now I will never, ever acknowledge you.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.450
I was right not to accept you from the start!

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:10.000
Dina-<i>kun</i>, not so fast.

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:12.910
Makoto-<i>kun </i>is not some irresponsible little boy.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:18.080
I needed him to go with
Kana tonight, not with me.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:21.120
Dina, don't go making these
assumptions all on your own.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:25.700
You need to realize how
narrow your view is becoming.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:32.410
But I... I don't accept him,
no matter what you say, Master!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:38.750
Dina...

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:42.200
I'm sorry, kid. I mean, Makoto.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.700
Not at all. Everything he said is the truth.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.330
Never mind me, please go easy on Dina.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:54.040
I'm sure he'll be concerned over
having you snap at him, Gregory-<i>sensei</i>.

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:58.700
Heh, kid, you have a
broader view than Dina, huh?

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:02.620
I will make some tea.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:06.620
The first thing we should do is
celebrate the success of your mission.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:10.660
Right. All we can do about
Dina is leave him up to Master.

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:13.700
It won't help anyone if we're mopey, too.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.080
Right.

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:21.080
Congratulations on your success.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:24.870
I'm so glad everything went according to plan.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.040
Why do I feel the way I do?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.120
That guy is just a...

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:46.580
Aw, I'm exhausted.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.410
Hatena, don't you have to pack?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:50.870
Yeah, but...

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:55.000
...everything fit in my travel bag
when we came, but now it won't.

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:59.160
Hey. Is your packing coming along?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.750
Yes. I'm just about finished.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:05.120
Father, tell me, were you able to reach Mother?

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:08.040
No, for some reason...

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:12.120
Oh. But once we deliver the Artifacts,

00:10:12.120 --> 00:10:14.870
Mother will be able to come
home right away, won't she?

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:17.080
Yeah, that's right.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:21.160
All we have to do is get the
Violin of the Earth God safely back to Japan.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.080
Bryan said he was going
to throw us a party today

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:26.700
to celebrate our successful performance.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.830
All right, here's to Sir Camelot

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:40.750
and Mr. Mamoru's successful performance!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:43.950
Cheers!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:56.000
Bryan-<i>san</i>, thank you for everything.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:57.500
Oh, not at all.

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:02.040
It is an honor to invite the talented
magician Mamoru Hoshisato over.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:04.700
I couldn't be more proud.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.160
How is your business doing?

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.790
Things are tougher now, compared
to when my father was in charge.

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:13.620
Oh, yeah? If you're having
any trouble, I'll help you out.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.950
I owe it to your father, after all.

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.870
Thank you very much.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:22.540
If my father were here,
I doubt it would have come to this...

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:33.660
Master, Mistress Yumemi is...

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.790
Oh, is it this late already?

00:11:36.790 --> 00:11:40.000
Excuse me, Bryan-<i>san</i>, but we should really be...

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:46.540
Oh, how rude of me, keeping
your daughters up as late as this.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.540
Come on, Mistress Yumemi, it is time to go.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:53.580
You need to have a shower
before you go to sleep.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:55.540
Not a chance.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.120
Oh come on, Yumemi.

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.200
Good night, Dina.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.540
Okay, Yumemi...

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.660
Hey, don't run away!

00:12:15.660 --> 00:12:18.000
Big sister, no fair.

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:27.330
I must say, you did very well.
You acquired the treasure with no difficulty.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:30.080
Mm-hmm, and we have Jeeves-<i>san </i>to thank.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:33.950
No, this was a tribute to your
combination play with Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:37.540
In other words, we can chalk it up to love.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:42.870
W-Well, I do count on Makoto,
and I <i>am </i>at ease when he is around...

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.790
All of which establishes that he is your prince.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.660
How do you figure <i>that</i>?!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.790
What's wrong?

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:54.120
Both of you, please remain right here.

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:01.830
Hatena?!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.700
Kana! Yumemi!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.790
Oh, Mamoru-<i>sama</i>!

00:13:09.910 --> 00:13:11.620
It looks like you're all safe.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:15.750
Y-Yes, we're all fine, so both
of you, get out of here already!

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.080
R-Right, we will!

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:22.870
Mamoru-<i>sama</i>, who exactly are these men?

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:27.870
They were all at the party. And this attack...

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:31.000
I don't see any other choice
but to suspect Mr. Bryan.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.160
You mean, Mr. Bryan is after the Artifact, too?

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:38.450
We don't have time to find out.
We're getting out of here immediately.

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.200
I am terribly sorry for this,

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.000
but I cannot allow you to leave like this.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:46.540
Who are you?

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:53.160
The real lord of this manor.
My name is Michelle Li.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.040
The "real" lord?

00:13:56.040 --> 00:14:01.750
Yes. My group has purchased
this mansion and everyone with it.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:07.370
You see, Mr. Bryan's business has failed,
and he is in a great deal of debt.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.370
That's...!

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.000
The Artifact!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:17.000
I took it while you were
fooling around in the bath.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:22.290
Give it back! That's something--
something important to Mother!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.080
Yumemi...

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:31.120
Something important, huh? Do you even
know the true nature of this Artifact?

00:14:34.370 --> 00:14:37.200
So, it's true.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.120
Huh?

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:41.160
The Violin of the Earth God
is really just the bow.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:47.870
The violin itself is an Artifact, but
ultimately, all we really need is the bow.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:51.500
Yes. And as for the violin itself...

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:57.250
Do you know what this Artifact is?
If it hadn't been camouflaged like this,

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.660
I wouldn't have been able
to slip through your barrier.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.580
Father's barrier?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.830
Once our lodging was set up,

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:08.370
I put several defensive Artifacts in place
as a response to dangerous Artifacts,

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:10.120
setting up a barrier.

00:15:10.120 --> 00:15:13.370
However, it was bringing
the Violin of the Earth God here

00:15:13.370 --> 00:15:16.620
and putting it with those Artifacts
that made your barrier worthless.

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.700
What's worse, it was your
own daughter who brought it.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.000
Oh, no...

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.950
Kana, it's not your fault.
This is on me for overlooking it.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.750
But... this one is especially bad.

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.000
That's right.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.830
Michelle-<i>sama</i>...

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:35.250
This is your worst enemy.

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.950
Huh? Muff-<i>kun</i>, what's the matter?

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:47.330
Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.870
Gaugau!

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.160
Oh, no. Does this mean...?

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.540
A forbidden Artifact that has
brought down many a hidden village--

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:00.620
the White Orb of Disillusionment.

00:16:00.620 --> 00:16:03.160
Yes. The White Orb of Disillusionment,

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.870
which can render all other Artifacts
in a certain range inoperable.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:09.750
The Hoshisato family are now just mere mortals.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:12.410
Now, let's make a deal.

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:14.910
In return for the Violin of the Earth God,

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:18.580
I will take <i>all </i>the Artifacts that you have.

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.410
And of course, you will
tell me their true names.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.700
If we refuse?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:26.660
Do you really have to ask?
You will lose the Violin of the Earth God,

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:29.870
as well as your other Artifacts,
and then your lives.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:39.160
There's no contest when it comes to
my daughters' lives or the Artifacts.

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.700
I will do as you say.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.580
Father!

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:45.450
What choice is there? I think
Maeve would do the same thing.

00:16:45.450 --> 00:16:51.660
Smart decision. But I am the cautious type.
You can never be too careful.

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:57.000
Who are you people?! If you've done
anything to the <i>sensei</i>, I'll make you pay!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:57.870
Dina!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.290
Makoto! Kana! What in the
world is going on here?!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:05.950
Now, why don't you hand over
all your Artifacts, nice and easy?

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.790
We'll give you our Artifacts.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:11.910
So don't do anything to
the children, or to Dina-<i>kun</i>.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:12.580
--Ema...

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.580
--Right.
--Ema...

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:23.370
The Artifacts I've gathered are
here in this trunk. Take it with you.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:26.910
I'll get the children's from
them now and hand them over.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:30.120
Very well. Have the maid bring it over here.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:31.080
Ema...

00:17:31.080 --> 00:17:32.250
Right.

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.250
Is that...?

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.290
What's the matter? Don't stop halfway.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.250
Impossible! They shouldn't
be able to use Artifacts!

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:03.410
Ha, it's just plain magic. I happen to be
something of a magician, you see.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.410
Mistresses, this way!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:08.410
I'm accustomed to this smoke. It's now or never!

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:11.410
Keep your eyes peeled!
Don't let the kids get away!

00:18:16.750 --> 00:18:19.700
Shoot them! Don't give them any chances!

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:23.160
Trust yourself. It'll be okay.
They won't hit you.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:27.080
Sensei!

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.080
Damn it!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.330
Dina, hurry!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:32.250
Makoto!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.950
Kill them.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:40.540
It goes against my principles
to use violence on a woman, but...

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:43.200
Makoto-<i>kun</i>, toss it away!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:43.910
--There!

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:44.370
--Why, you...!
--There!

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:45.620
--Why, you...!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:48.830
Makoto!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:50.750
Vanishing Magic!

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:53.120
We need to fall back. Hurry!

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.830
It looks like everything is okay now.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.330
Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:04.500
My word...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:06.910
Master, thank you very much.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:10.290
Hmm. I can't believe Dina got caught up in this.

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:12.830
I'm to blame, as well.

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:15.370
The immediate danger appears to have passed.

00:19:15.370 --> 00:19:17.450
Father!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:19.790
I'm all right, my precious.

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:23.160
I am troubled by the way
this Michelle woman retreated.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:24.870
I hope the others are all right.

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:30.950
Makoto... Dina...

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:38.160
We managed to get all the way out here.

00:19:39.160 --> 00:19:40.910
My disappearing act...

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:44.330
It all happened so fast,
I couldn't control the shock.

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:49.330
I have to stop the bleeding where he was shot.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.080
What's this...?

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:03.870
Where are we...? Makoto!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:09.750
Wh-What were you about to do
to me while I was knocked out?!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.250
I was going to treat your wound!

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:14.580
But never mind that, Dina, you're a <i>girl</i>?!

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:17.830
Th-This is... j-just fat...

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:22.410
N-No, that's an awfully big stretch,
any way you look at it.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:28.620
Dina, why do you dress like a boy?

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.290
Because if I didn't, I couldn't
have become an apprentice.

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:34.950
Not like you did, nice and easily.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:39.410
I hate you.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:42.500
You have the same dream as me, at the same age,

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:45.410
but you are far more fortunate than I am.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:49.830
You're a boy, and you've
been accepted by Gregory-<i>sensei</i>.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:57.290
That's why I hate you. I hate you,
I'm angry with you, and I envy you!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:58.950
I'm sorry.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:04.160
You have nothing to apologize for.
This is my own ugly jealousy.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:10.250
I get it. I may dress like a boy,
but that doesn't make me a boy.

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:17.950
What's that?

00:21:17.950 --> 00:21:20.750
Smile Stick is alerting us to danger.

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.910
Dina, we're getting out of here, right now.

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:25.200
That group from before is sure to be coming.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:31.370
Dina! Hurry!

00:21:31.370 --> 00:21:33.540
I know!

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.200
Are you okay, Dina?

00:21:35.200 --> 00:21:37.950
You don't have to be so worried about me.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:41.830
I am... Sensei's number-one apprentice.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:44.660
They're catching up.

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:46.500
Dina, hurry!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:58.830
Too bad. Your date is over.

00:22:02.410 --> 00:22:08.250
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:08.250 --> 00:22:16.620
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:23.040
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:23.040 --> 00:22:27.080
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:30.250
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:35.330
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:40.500
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:45.540
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:50.700
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:57.950
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.750
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:03.080
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.330
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:05.330 --> 00:23:08.080
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:11.910
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.450
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:16.700
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:20.370
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:24.660
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:38.870
"Have you had anything great happen lately?"

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:49.830
"Dina"

00:23:51.910 --> 00:24:01.830
"The airdate for the 12th episode
finale will be announced on the official
Hatena☆Illusion anime website"
